Subject: [PATCH 1/2] agents: advance selection on delete + add LLM model
 picker

When deleting an agent from the Agents list, advance the selection to the
next row (or the previous one when deleting the last row) instead of
resetting to the top of the list.

Add an LLM model dropdown beside the provider picker in the "Start a new
agent" composer. The chosen model is passed to the agent: Claude Code's
`--model` for the transcript path, and the runner's model override for the
API-key providers. The available models follow the selected provider.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
