+-Subject: [PATCH] fix: Prioritize-from-README uses Claude Code OAuth, not the
+- metered API
+-
+-When "Claude Code" was selected in the Prioritize agent picker, the code
+-read the stored Claude API key first and only fell back to the claude.ai
+-subscription OAuth token when that key was empty. A user signed in to
+-Claude Code who also had a Claude API key configured therefore hit the
+-metered API and failed with "credit balance too low".
+-
+-Route an explicit Claude Code selection to the OAuth token exclusively,
+-ignoring any stored API key, and tell the user to sign in to Claude Code
+-(rather than add an API key) when no token is found. "Claude API" and
+-"OpenAI API" keep using their respective keys.
+-
+-Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
