+---
+
+Resolves the ad-hoc request on the Agents tab.
+
+## Advance to the next agent on delete
+Deleting an agent from the list now advances the selection to the next row
+(or the previous one when the last row is removed) instead of snapping back
+to the top of the list. Works for both stored sessions and external
+(watch-only) rows.
+
+## Model picker in "Start a new agent"
+A second dropdown sits beside the agent (Claude Code) picker, listing the
